<title>USA: HealthSouth merger waiting period expires.</title>
<headline>HealthSouth merger waiting period expires.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthSouth Corp and Health Images Inc said on Tuesday that the waiting period for their proposed merger under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act has expired without comment.</p>
<p>The merger must be approved by Health Images  stockholders, who will vote on it at a special meeting March 3.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
